NAME
       usermod - modify a user account

SYNOPSIS
       usermod [-aG sudo] [-rG sudo] [-s shell] <name>

DESCRIPTION
       Changes an existing account.

OPTIONS
       -aG sudo   add the account to the sudoers
       -rG sudo   remove it from the sudoers
       -s SHELL   set the login shell

SEE ALSO
       useradd(1), sudo(1), groups(1)
